modulate = Color(0.4627451, 0.1764706, 0.11764706, 1)
text = "Dear son,
The day has come. After long thirteen years 
you stand here a man,
and it is time you took up my work.
Take my trusty musket and my kerosene kettle,
and walk the path of a true lamplighter.
Face the fears and nightmares that crawl out of the dark,
and give the world the light it so badly needs.
Take shelter under the dim lights of the lamps on the left to light up the strong lamps on the right.
BTW ghosts can dodge bullets and hit hard.
Your Father
Press E to begin"
font = ExtResource("3_wfs7u")
font_size = 64
